    "Run AssemblyScanner; fix FAILED first",
    "Photon: rediscover by MulticastDelegate Invoke(byte,object,int), then rebind properties",
    "Session: StartNewSession(World, Sandbox, ...) then session-data fields by nested types",
    "Prefer FindFieldByType (GameModifier[], BikeType, List<Checkpoint>) over gobbledygook names",
    "Keep English anchors: Prefs keys, GameModifier.name strings, joint names, laxjiuc"
